This skill is a trimmed, adapted fork of prompt-master by Nidhin Joseph Nelson
(https://github.com/nidhinjs/prompt-master), harvested 2026-08-21. The original is
MIT-licensed; its license text is reproduced below and applies to the material carried
over into this fork (the task-brief structure, the intent-extraction table, the failure
taxonomy, and the positional layout). Tool routing was narrowed to Claude Code and Claude
chat/API only, version-specific claims were removed, and the context-block behavior was
rewritten to point at this machine's project docs instead of re-pasting facts into every
prompt — see `~/Development/Development Base/.claude/TOOLING.md` for the harvest note.

